// Commis's interface text, in English. Other languages lay their own
// _100_commis.cst over this one, in uitext/<language>.dir, and any value they
// leave out or leave empty falls back to this table. %s and %d are filled in
// by the app.

// The window
app title ^Commis^
window minimize ^Minimize^
window maximize ^Maximize^
window close ^Close^

// The toolbar
toolbar add ^Add^
toolbar add later ^Adding comes in a later version.^
toolbar export ^Export^
toolbar export later ^Exporting comes in a later version.^
toolbar filter ^Status filter^
filter all ^All statuses^

// Statuses
status pending ^Pending^
status paid ^Paid^
status cancelled ^Cancelled^
status refunded ^Refunded^

// The sidebar
sidebar name ^Sections^
section commissions ^Commissions^
section ych ^YCH^
section raffles ^Raffles^

// The record list
list name ^Records^
column client ^Client^
column title ^Title^
column fee ^Fee^
column status ^Status^
column date ^Date^
empty commissions ^No commissions yet.^
empty commissions filtered ^No %s commissions.^
empty ych ^No YCH entries yet.^
empty ych filtered ^No %s YCH entries.^

// The detail pane
detail status ^Status^
detail fee ^Fee^
detail title ^Title^
detail slot ^Slot^
detail reference ^Reference^
detail description ^Description^
detail added ^Added^
detail none commission ^Select a commission to see it here.^
detail none ych ^Select a YCH entry to see it here.^

// Raffles
raffles title ^Raffles aren't in the window yet^
raffles body ^Raffles have the most steps of anything in Commis, so the window starts with commissions and YCH. Until raffles arrive here, run commis raffle in a terminal.^

// The database and its problems
database line ^%s · schema %d · commis %s^
unavailable ^Nothing to show until commis answers.^
problem dismiss ^Dismiss^
problem not found ^Couldn't find commis. Set %s to its path, or put it on the PATH.^
problem cannot start ^Couldn't start commis at %s: %s^
problem timeout ^commis didn't answer within %d seconds.^
problem unreadable ^commis printed an answer the window couldn't read.^
problem exit code ^commis exited with %d.^
